I just added a slightly modded version of Wakaba to jbotcan where you can
upload sound recordings or play other people's inside the browser:

http://jbotcan.org/sance/wakaba.html

It's basically like jbobac, but based on existing open source libraries and
just plugged together.

Timo suggested http://www.longtailvideo.com/players/jw-flv-player/ and it
looked good. So you can upload and play anything JW FLV can play. Serious
business open source flash player.

I'll be using it to collect recordings for la lojbo bangu ctuca pixra.

Cheers,

Christopher

